0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 674.0 Tm (are not automatically removed.) Tj ET
0.07 0.39 0.47 rg BT /F2 13 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 646.0 Tm (5. Retention and safe deletion decisions) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 618.0 Tm (The default threshold is 28 x 24 hours from execution. A complete independent VBK/VIB chain) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 605.0 Tm (is considered only when every member has both an old recognized restore-point timestamp and) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 592.0 Tm (an old file modification timestamp. A newer full in the same folder may start a separate) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 579.0 Tm (chain. Any newer dependent incremental or retained VBM reference can protect the older full.) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 559.0 Tm (Decision / Meaning) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 547.0 Tm (PURGE_CANDIDATE / Eligible for another set of checks immediately before unlink) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 535.0 Tm (RETAIN / Required by a newer restore point or metadata dependency) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 523.0 Tm (IMMUTABLE / Protected by an immutable XFS file attribute) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 511.0 Tm (REVIEW / Ambiguous naming, shared or unreadable metadata, unsupported format, or other) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 499.0 Tm (unresolved safety issue) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 8.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 57.0 487.0 Tm (FAILED_OR_BLOCKED / A proposed deletion stopped or failed; inspect the journal) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 468.0 Tm (The tool never modifies VBMs, removes .veeam.N.lock immutability tracking files, clears) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 455.0 Tm (immutable attributes, updates GFS settings, changes VBR registration, or deletes directories.) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 442.0 Tm (A .veeam.N.lock marker does not by itself prove that a Veeam job is running.) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 422.0 Tm (Before deleting candidate groups, the utility checks file identities, backup-file handles) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 409.0 Tm (with fuser, metadata references, marker changes, and repository changes. It refuses nested or) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 396.0 Tm (bind mounts, symlinks, incomplete files, and overlapping cleanup runs. These checks reduce) Tj ET
0.16 0.20 0.25 rg BT /F1 9.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 52.0 383.0 Tm (risk but cannot prevent a Veeam writer from starting between checks.) Tj ET
